---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import sheet from '../data/thanksgiving-gratitude.json';

const roman = ['I', 'II', 'III', 'IV', 'V', 'VI'];
const total = sheet.sections.reduce((n, s) => n + s.sources.length, 0);
// One line to stand for each section on this page (the full text lives on /sourcesheets/gratitude)
const pull: Record<number, { quote: string; who: string }> = {
  0: { quote: 'Here he showed his ingratitude.', who: 'Rashi on Adam: “the woman whom You gave to be with me”' },
  1: { quote: 'The very act of the creation is an act of God’s loving-kindness.', who: 'Maimonides, Guide 3:53' },
  2: { quote: 'No one thanked the Holy One, blessed be He, until Leah came and thanked Him.', who: 'Berakhot 7b' },
  3: { quote: 'MODEH also means: I confess!', who: 'R. Norman Lamm, Thank Heaven (1961)' },
  4: { quote: 'Gratitude must be constantly fed (unlike resentment, which lives on naturally).', who: 'Dennis Prager, on Genesis 35:1' },
  5: { quote: 'God’s gifts are meant to flow through us and not merely to us.', who: 'R. Shai Held, The Heart of Torah' },
};
const stills: Record<number, string> = { 1: 'still1', 3: 'still0', 4: 'still3', 5: 'still2' };
---

<Layout
  title="Gratitude: A Thanksgiving Source Sheet"
  description="Hakarat ha-tov from Genesis to the Pilgrims' turkey: a 35-source sheet, a short film, a printable PDF, and a vertical short on the Hebrew root of thanks."
  image="/thanksgiving/og.jpg"
  imageAlt="A candlelit Thanksgiving table seen from above, with the words: God's gifts are meant to flow through us, not merely to us."
>
  <main class="tg">
    <section class="hero">
      <video class="hero-bg" src="/thanksgiving/gratitude-film.mp4" poster="/thanksgiving/stills/still2.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-hidden="true"></video>
      <div class="hero-in">
        <p class="kick">A Thanksgiving source sheet</p>
        <h1>Gratitude</h1>
        <p class="he hero-he" dir="rtl" lang="he">{sheet.title_he}</p>
        <p class="sub">{sheet.subtitle.replace('A Thanksgiving source sheet: ', '')}</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn gold" href="/thanksgiving/gratitude-source-sheet.pdf" download>Download the PDF</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/sourcesheets/gratitude">Read all {total} sources</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#film">Watch the film</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap intro">
      <p>{sheet.intro}</p>
    </section>

    <section id="film" class="wrap film">
      <div class="label">The film &middot; 36 seconds</div>
      <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/thanksgiving/film-poster.jpg" src="/thanksgiving/gratitude-film.mp4"></video>
      <p class="cap">Dawn, a farm, a table and an altar at Bethel, each carrying one line from the sheet. Footage generated with Higgsfield; titles built and rendered in HyperFrames.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap root">
      <div class="root-vid">
        <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/thanksgiving/one-root-poster.jpg" src="/thanksgiving/one-root.mp4"></video>
      </div>
      <div class="root-txt">
        <div class="label">One root &middot; for your story</div>
        <h2><span class="he" dir="rtl" lang="he">י·ד·ה</span></h2>
        <p>In Hebrew, <em>todah</em> (thank you), <em>modeh</em> (I admit), <em>vidui</em> (confession) and <em>Yehudah</em> all grow from one root. Rabbi Norman Lamm traced all three meanings through Judah’s life: Leah names him in gratitude, he confesses “she is more right than I,” and Jacob crowns him with “your brothers shall acknowledge you.”</p>
        <p class="big">To give thanks is to admit you needed someone.</p>
        <p class="cap">A 24-second vertical short, built in HyperFrames. Made to share.</p>
        <a class="btn gold" href="/thanksgiving/one-root.mp4" download>Download the short</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap sections">
      <div class="label">Inside the sheet</div>
      <div class="grid">
        {sheet.sections.map((s, i) => (
          <a class="card" href="/sourcesheets/gratitude" style={stills[i] ? `--img:url(/thanksgiving/stills/${stills[i]}.jpg)` : ''} data-photo={stills[i] ? 'y' : 'n'}>
            <div class="num">{roman[i]} &middot; {s.sources.length} sources</div>
            <div class="he card-he" dir="rtl" lang="he">{s.title_he}</div>
            <h3>{s.title}</h3>
            <blockquote>“{pull[i].quote}”<cite>{pull[i].who}</cite></blockquote>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap table">
      <div class="label">At the table</div>
      <h2>Questions to pass around</h2>
      <ol>{sheet.questions.map((q) => <li>{q}</li>)}</ol>
      <div class="todah">
        <h3>A five-minute todah</h3>
        <p>The thanksgiving offering couldn’t be finished alone, so you had to invite people. Before dessert, go around the table: each person names one thing they were given this year that they did not make or earn, and one person they will thank this week who isn’t here. Then say it the old way: <em>Modeh ani</em>, “I admit it: I needed help.”</p>
      </div>
      <p class="close"><span class="he" dir="rtl" lang="he">הוֹדוּ לַה׳ כִּי טוֹב</span><br /><em>Give thanks, for it is good.</em></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Frank+Ruhl+Libre:wght@500;700&display=swap');
  .tg { --bg:#140c08; --ink:#fbf3e4; --soft:#cdbba2; --gold:#e2b25c; --ember:#d9773a; --line:rgba(226,178,92,.25);
    background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size:20px; line-height:1.5; }
  .he { font-family:'Frank Ruhl Libre', serif; }
  .wrap { max-width:1060px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 16px; }
  .label, .kick { font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.3em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ember); margin-bottom:14px; }
  .hero { position:relative; min-height:88vh; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; overflow:hidden; }
  .hero-bg { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; opacity:.55; }
  .hero::after { content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,12,8,.2) 0%, rgba(20,12,8,.6) 55%, var(--bg) 100%); }
  .hero-in { position:relative; z-index:2; max-width:1060px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 16px 64px; width:100%; }
  .hero h1 { font-size:clamp(64px, 14vw, 150px); font-weight:600; line-height:.9; margin:0; }
  .hero-he { font-size:clamp(28px, 5vw, 46px); color:var(--gold); margin:6px 0 0; text-align:left; }
  .sub { font-style:italic; font-size:clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 27px); max-width:640px; margin:14px 0 26px; color:#f1e4cc; }
  .cta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; }
  .btn { display:inline-block; padding:12px 20px; border:1px solid var(--gold); color:var(--ink); border-radius:999px; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; transition:background .2s; }
  .btn:hover { background:rgba(226,178,92,.15); }
  .btn.gold { background:var(--gold); color:#1c120b; }
  .btn.gold:hover { background:#f0c879; }
  .intro p { font-size:clamp(21px, 2.4vw, 25px); font-style:italic; color:var(--soft); border-left:3px solid var(--gold); padding-left:22px; margin:0; max-width:820px; }
  video { width:100%; display:block; border-radius:6px; background:#000; }
  .cap { font-size:16px; color:var(--soft); margin-top:12px; }
  .root { display:grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 340px) 1fr; gap:48px; align-items:center; }
  .root h2 { font-size:72px; color:var(--gold); margin:0; line-height:1; }
  .root p { margin:14px 0; }
  .root .big { font-size:30px; font-style:italic; color:var(--gold); line-height:1.2; }
  .grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap:18px; }
  .card { position:relative; display:block; padding:26px; min-height:300px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; overflow:hidden; background:#1d120b; transition:transform .2s, border-color .2s; }
  .card[data-photo='y'] { background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,12,8,.35), rgba(20,12,8,.93) 62%), var(--img) center/cover; }
  .card:hover { transform:translateY(-3px); border-color:var(--gold); }
  .num { font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.25em; color:var(--gold); }
  .card-he { font-size:30px; color:var(--gold); margin-top:40px; text-align:left; }
  .card h3 { font-size:28px; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; line-height:1.1; }
  .card blockquote { margin:0; font-style:italic; font-size:18px; color:#efe1c8; }
  .card cite { display:block; font-style:normal; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:var(--soft); margin-top:8px; }
  .table h2 { font-size:44px; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 18px; }
  .table ol { font-size:22px; padding-left:28px; max-width:820px; list-style:decimal; }
  .table li::marker { color:var(--gold); font-weight:600; }
  .table li { margin-bottom:14px; padding-left:6px; }
  .todah { border:1px solid var(--line); background:#1d120b; border-radius:6px; padding:26px 28px; margin-top:28px; max-width:820px; }
  .todah h3 { font-size:28px; margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--gold); }
  .todah p { margin:0; }
  .close { text-align:center; margin-top:56px; font-size:22px; }
  .close .he { font-size:40px; color:var(--gold); }
  @media (max-width:760px) {
    .root { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; }
    .root-vid { max-width:340px; margin:0 auto; width:100%; }
    .wrap { padding:40px 16px; }
  }
</style>
